# FRONT BUGFIX — gates

**Артефакт:** `memory-bank/front/bugfix/bugfix-YYYYMMDD-<slug>.md`

## Gates

1. Описание бага получено
2. `load_now` first; core docs — только cross-cutting (§8)
3. Root cause; no mask/fallback
4. Regression red → fix → green
5. **Scenario:** user-visible UI symptom → Playwright targeted **обязателен** (не только Vitest); parent runs
6. bugfix-файл complete; scenario path в Handoff
7. §0.11 если applicable

## Abort

- Workaround → reject
- Tests skipped → no FINISH
- User-visible fix без Playwright scenario → no FINISH
- Handoff «manual smoke only» без scenario path → reject
